## Deploy (GCP Cloud Run)

Terraform in `infra/terraform/` provisions Artifact Registry, Cloud SQL (Postgres),
and one Cloud Run service per app service.

```bash
cd infra/terraform
terraform init
terraform plan -var project_id=YOUR_PROJECT -var region={{ region }}
```
